        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*holds the label at arm's length* Noakes, it says, plain as plough-dirt. But I've ordered nothing and I'm owed nothing, and them as says otherwise is wrong. Whitfoot's muddled his labels again -- that'll be for <CUSTOM6340>, <CUSTOM6341>, mark my words."
          }
        }
      },
